WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.110 --> 00:00:02.260
People of the internet, RetroRaconteur here.

00:00:02.260 --> 00:00:04.840
I’m just a dad who loves games and the stories
they tell.

00:00:04.840 --> 00:00:09.469
For today’s video - whether you need a refresher
on confirmed Hogwarts Legacy details or if

00:00:09.469 --> 00:00:13.339
you’re looking for news on the game for
the first time, wands at the ready.

00:00:13.339 --> 00:00:17.340
Because here are 35 Hogwarts Legacy facts
we know for sure.

00:00:17.340 --> 00:00:22.550
Hogwarts Legacy is being developed by Avalanche
Software - nope, not the Just Cause devs - the

00:00:22.550 --> 00:00:23.970
Cars 3 devs.

00:00:23.970 --> 00:00:28.140
In fact, this will be the longest Avalanche
has worked on a single title given that Cars

00:00:28.140 --> 00:00:31.300
3 released all the way back in 2017.

00:00:31.300 --> 00:00:34.820
The game is being developed as an open-world
action RPG

00:00:34.820 --> 00:00:38.500
And it’s set in the late 1800s wizarding
world of Harry Potter.

00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:42.790
As a result, we won’t be seeing Harry, Ron,
or Hermione make an appearance in the game.

00:00:42.790 --> 00:00:46.540
That being said, the devs have confirmed we’ll
meet up with Gryffindor House ghost - Nearly

00:00:46.540 --> 00:00:47.540
Headless Nick.

00:00:47.540 --> 00:00:49.160
Fingers crossed we get Peeves as well.

00:00:49.160 --> 00:00:53.559
We’ll also be traveling to familiar locations
including the Forbidden Forest and Hogsmeade

00:00:53.559 --> 00:00:54.559
Village.

00:00:54.559 --> 00:01:00.000
Players will also find new and unexpected
locations, characters, and story elements along the way.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:03.790
Magical creatures will feature prominently
and a number of them have already been confirmed

00:01:03.790 --> 00:01:09.650
including centaurs, goblins, graphorns, mooncalves,
spiders, trolls, and hippogriffs.

00:01:09.650 --> 00:01:13.150
The official trailer even shows we’ll be able to
ride hippogriffs.

00:01:13.150 --> 00:01:16.990
Cats and owls are also shown in the trailer,
although we don’t know for sure about toads just yet.

00:01:17.990 --> 00:01:21.670
As for the more nefarious creatures, both
inferi and dementors will make an appearance.

00:01:21.670 --> 00:01:24.210
There’s also this enormous dragon.

00:01:24.210 --> 00:01:27.400
If you look carefully at the official wallpaper for the game - which you can download from

00:01:27.400 --> 00:01:32.030
the Hogwarts Legacy website - you’ll be
able to spot fwoopers and an enormous acromantula 

00:01:32.030 --> 00:01:33.400
hidden in the forest.

00:01:33.400 --> 00:01:36.970
JK Rowling is not directly involved in the
project, however, Hogwarts Legacy does plan to adhere

00:01:36.987 --> 00:01:41.521
to the wizarding world lore set forth in the Harry Potter books.

00:01:41.530 --> 00:01:46.456
Player choice will play a significant role
in the game with us having to choose if we want to be good or bad.

00:01:46.460 --> 00:01:51.270
We’ll also be able to select companions
to aid and fight alongside us in our journey.

00:01:51.270 --> 00:01:55.007
When it comes to schooling at Hogwarts, a lot of folks are wondering about the sorting ceremony. 

00:01:55.007 --> 00:01:59.558
It's already been confirmed that we'll be able to choose our house at the start of the game.

00:01:59.590 --> 00:02:05.009
As for the day to day at Hogwarts, we’ll be mastering spells, brewing potions, and taming fantastic beasts.

00:02:05.026 --> 00:02:12.011
There's an IMDB page that lists Jylian Petrie, Demetrious Daniels, Lawrence Kern, and Catherine Lonsdale among the cast for the game.

00:02:12.011 --> 00:02:19.012
Julia Farino is another actress who had previously appeared on the page; however, it has since been removed.

00:02:19.029 --> 00:02:24.013
At the time, it said she would be playing the characters of Cassandra Mason and Helen Thistlewood.

00:02:24.013 --> 00:02:28.798
As far as the story goes, the main character
receives a late acceptance letter to Hogwarts

00:02:28.800 --> 00:02:32.780
and will be on a journey to uncover a hidden
truth of the wizarding world.

00:02:32.780 --> 00:02:39.016
Our character will also have a special ability to perceive and master ancient magic...whatever that means.

00:02:39.020 --> 00:02:42.581
We’ll be able to customize our character
and also upgrade various talents, although

00:02:42.581 --> 00:02:45.300
the specifics on this are still unknown.

00:02:45.300 --> 00:02:50.269
Broomsticks and flying are shown in the trailer, although we don’t yet know for sure if quidditch will make an appearance.

00:02:50.270 --> 00:02:52.550
Adrian Ropp is head of story on the project.

00:02:52.550 --> 00:02:58.970
He has a wide-range of experiences with top companies like Pixar, Marvel, Disney, Lucasfilm and of course, WB.

00:02:58.970 --> 00:03:04.300
A full trailer of the game leaked all the
way back in 2018 when reddit user VapethisBro

00:03:04.300 --> 00:03:05.910
posted it online.

00:03:05.910 --> 00:03:09.480
He claimed to have been a part of a mall survey
group that was shown a trailer for the game

00:03:09.480 --> 00:03:12.510
and he somehow managed to get by without signing an NDA.

00:03:12.510 --> 00:03:16.610
The leaked footage showed what appeared to be a dark, mature wizarding world game with one

00:03:16.610 --> 00:03:21.459
particular scene that showed a group of goblins
meeting a rather gruesome fate.

00:03:21.459 --> 00:03:28.010
Specific spells were also shown in that trailer, including lumos, alohomora, reparo, stupefy, expulso, and depulso.

00:03:28.019 --> 00:03:32.100
It’s also worth noting that even though
it’s pretty clear this was a legit leak,

00:03:32.100 --> 00:03:36.000
it still doesn’t mean we’ll see all of
these items in the final game.

00:03:36.000 --> 00:03:40.440
Hogwarts Legacy was finally announced in an
official capacity with a trailer at the PS5

00:03:40.440 --> 00:03:43.190
showcase event back in September of 2020.

00:03:43.190 --> 00:03:49.664
The game was originally slated for a 2021 release date, but has since been delayed to the ever-nebulous, “2022.”

00:03:49.680 --> 00:03:57.449
Avalanche has confirmed the game will appear on PC, PS4, PS5, Xbox One, as well as the Xbox Series S &amp; X.

00:03:57.459 --> 00:04:02.260
WB is publishing the game under the Portkey
games label, which is a label specifically

00:04:02.260 --> 00:04:04.690
created for the Wizarding World of Harry Potter.

00:04:04.690 --> 00:04:07.450
We also know they’re using the Unreal Engine
for the project

00:04:07.450 --> 00:04:11.860
And although information has been scarce since the initial trailer, WarnerMedia’s CEO Jason

00:04:11.860 --> 00:04:17.150
Kilar tweeted out 4 concept images back in
April of 2021, which showed the house crests,

00:04:17.150 --> 00:04:23.930
a baby dragon, a garden gnome, and two graphorns in a small enclosure on what appear to be the Hogwarts grounds.

00:04:23.930 --> 00:04:27.469
Also, one of the Avalanche devs who works on the sound design for the game did an interview

00:04:27.469 --> 00:04:31.006
in May of 2021 where he answered some questions about the game. 

00:04:31.006 --> 00:04:38.007
The full interview actually included a variety of topics about game development, but there were also a few questions specifically about Hogwarts Legacy.

00:04:38.007 --> 00:04:42.289
Unfortunately, the full interview was removed
from YouTube; however, I have a full break-down

00:04:42.289 --> 00:04:45.025
of the video here on my channel if you’re
interested in knowing all the details.

00:04:45.025 --> 00:04:48.526
You can check it out on the left side of your screen now and if you’re new here 

00:04:48.526 --> 00:04:53.310
and if you're new here and want to know more about Hogwarts Legacy, check out my full playlist on the right side of your screen now.

00:04:53.310 --> 00:04:56.969
Also, you can find official sources for all
of these facts in the video description below.

00:04:56.969 --> 00:05:00.809
As always, thank you all so much for watching,
I’ll talk to you again soon.

